  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">PIMS-6686 Towards a Sustainable City through Energy Efficiency in Kairouan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">The UNDP-GEF project is designed to promote low-carbon buildings and efficient public lighting in the Municipality of Kairouan. The results will eventually be scaled up to other municipalities and cities in Tunisia to support the National Programme for Sustainable Cities. The project will directly support the implementation of the Sustainable Development Strategy of Kairouan, the action plan for sustainable energy, and the updated Nationally Determined Contribution of Tunisia</narrative>
  </description>
